# Responsive & Animation Rules

## Responsiveness
The website MUST be flawlessly responsive. Optimize across these breakpoints using standard Tailwind prefixes (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:, 2xl:):
* 320px / 375px / 425px (Mobile - perfectly stacked grids, readable typography).
* 768px / 1024px (Tablet & Laptop).
* 1280px / 1440px / 1920px (Widescreen Desktop - ensure content containers do not stretch infinitely).

## Animations (Framer Motion)
Keep it strictly professional. 
- **Allowed:** Smooth fade-ins, subtle staggered entries for service cards, micro-interactions on button hovers.
- **Strictly Avoid:** Bouncing effects, excessive rotations, spinning icons, or slow heavy parallax that degrades performance.

