# SEO, Performance, & Security

## SEO
- Every page must export robust Next.js Metadata (Title, Description, OpenGraph).
- Strict heading hierarchy (Only one H1 per page, followed sequentially by H2, H3).
- Implement descriptive alt tags on all infrastructure diagrams and icons.

## Performance Targets
- Optimized Next.js images. Never load oversized uncompressed assets.
- Lazy load off-screen sections.
- Zero layout shift (CLS).

## Security
- Never hardcode API keys, Cloudflare tokens, or SMTP credentials.
- All sensitive operations must utilize server-side Environment Variables.

